              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mmodzi mwa ana aamuna a Yehoyada mwana Eliyasibu mkulu wa ansembe nʼkuti nthawi imeneyi ali mpongozi wa Sanibalati wa ku Horoni. Choncho ndinamuthamangitsa pamaso panga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
